From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:44:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix SABR first-response init: register FormatId before
 media samples.

MediaHeader lookup used FormatId.toString(), so itag 140 with last_modified
missed a FORMAT_INITIALIZATION_METADATA entry that omitted that field.
Use canonical itag/last_modified/xtags keys, reorder first UMP bodies so
format init is applied before samples, and keep throwing if the format
never registers. Seek reset no longer drops selected formats; session
reset clears the registry for a new video.
